{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07338","headline":"按覆後归睦州赠苗侍御 · 刘长卿","name":"按覆後归睦州赠苗侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地远心难达，天高谤易成。\n羊肠留覆辙，虎口脱余生。\n直氏偷金枉，于家决狱明。\n一言知己重，片议杀身轻。\n日下人谁忆，天涯客独行。\n年光销蹇步，秋气入衰情。\n建德知何在，长江问去程。\n孤舟百口渡，万里一猿声。\n落日开乡路，空山向郡城。\n岂令冤气积，千古在长平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07338.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07338","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}